# СТАДИЯ 5/5: ГРАФИКИ
#   1. Training curves (loss, mAP, P, R по эпохам)
#   2. Precision-Recall curves (AUC-PR = AP)
#   3. Confusion Matrix
#   4. Confidence Profile (P/R/F1 vs confidence threshold)
